    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Earth on the brink of annihilation, you step into the boots of the last surviving space marines. As a robot army is plotting to hurl a colossal asteroid into the planet you must embark on high-stakes missions where you'll engage in space battles and infiltrate enemy bases to prevent the Doomsday asteroid from wiping out humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments and Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With procedurally generated layouts, enemy placements and loot, no two playthroughs are the same. The destructible voxel based environments add a tactical layer to combat\u2014blast through walls or create new paths to outmanoeuvre enemies and change the battlefield in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/c9ac7880fd7a8f16996fcc0efa32670f.poster.avif?t=1755512523\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/c9ac7880fd7a8f16996fcc0efa32670f.webm?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/c9ac7880fd7a8f16996fcc0efa32670f.mp4?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Space Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of space combat where ships move with realistic Newtonian physics\u2014factoring in thrust, mass, and momentum. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/d175ce1c1fb17ec7b726c0a427aba964.poster.avif?t=1755512523\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/d175ce1c1fb17ec7b726c0a427aba964.webm?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/d175ce1c1fb17ec7b726c0a427aba964.mp4?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ray Tracing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience ray traced visuals with a custom engine designed for dynamic shadows, reflections, and transparency. Combined with the destructible block-based environments, it creates a fully immersive and visually stunning experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/1d05c2f4a649396be282e5976325c58b.poster.avif?t=1755512523\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/1d05c2f4a649396be282e5976325c58b.webm?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/1d05c2f4a649396be282e5976325c58b.mp4?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Asteroids</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the labyrinthine tunnel systems and use them to infiltrate and escape enemy asteroid bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/8088ca10e1fbc48fe19408edb14a9320.poster.avif?t=1755512523\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/8088ca10e1fbc48fe19408edb14a9320.webm?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/8088ca10e1fbc48fe19408edb14a9320.mp4?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Earth on the brink of annihilation, you step into the boots of the last surviving space marines. As a robot army is plotting to hurl a colossal asteroid into the planet you must embark on high-stakes missions where you'll engage in space battles and infiltrate enemy bases to prevent the Doomsday asteroid from wiping out humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments and Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With procedurally generated layouts, enemy placements and loot, no two playthroughs are the same. The destructible voxel based environments add a tactical layer to combat\u2014blast through walls or create new paths to outmanoeuvre enemies and change the battlefield in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/c9ac7880fd7a8f16996fcc0efa32670f.poster.avif?t=1755512523\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/c9ac7880fd7a8f16996fcc0efa32670f.webm?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/c9ac7880fd7a8f16996fcc0efa32670f.mp4?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Space Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of space combat where ships move with realistic Newtonian physics\u2014factoring in thrust, mass, and momentum. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/d175ce1c1fb17ec7b726c0a427aba964.poster.avif?t=1755512523\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/d175ce1c1fb17ec7b726c0a427aba964.webm?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/d175ce1c1fb17ec7b726c0a427aba964.mp4?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ray Tracing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience ray traced visuals with a custom engine designed for dynamic shadows, reflections, and transparency. Combined with the destructible block-based environments, it creates a fully immersive and visually stunning experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/1d05c2f4a649396be282e5976325c58b.poster.avif?t=1755512523\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/1d05c2f4a649396be282e5976325c58b.webm?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/1d05c2f4a649396be282e5976325c58b.mp4?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Asteroids</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the labyrinthine tunnel systems and use them to infiltrate and escape enemy asteroid bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/8088ca10e1fbc48fe19408edb14a9320.poster.avif?t=1755512523\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/8088ca10e1fbc48fe19408edb14a9320.webm?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462820/extras/8088ca10e1fbc48fe19408edb14a9320.mp4?t=1755512523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Cosmik Storm is a fast-paced single-player spaceship shooter and FPS. It features destructible environments, physics and ray traced graphics and lets you take the role of the last surviving space marines. Your mission is to overcome the robot army and prevent them from destroying Earth!",
